        <briefdescription>
<para>Get a pointer to the <computeroutput><ref refid="structmux__state" kindref="compound">mux_state</ref></computeroutput> object defined by <ref refid="group__mux__interface_1gac162201caf07686e7c9c8cd736ebf7e2" kindref="member">MUX_STATE_DT_SPEC_DEFINE_BY_IDX()</ref>. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Example devicetree fragment: <verbatim>mux0: mux-controller@... {
        compatible = &quot;vendor,demux&quot;;
